---
description: Monemee SDK - sell the app, paywall, license key validation
globs:
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user wants to sell the app with Monemee or add a paywall or license check:

- Web app with login: run `npx monemee init` (the user confirms the login in the browser), then set `getRef` to the real user ID. Put `monemee.webhook()` before `express.json()` and `monemee.routes()` after the login. Protect routes with `monemee.requireAccess()` or `<AccessGate fallback={<BuyButton />}>`.
- Downloadable software: `@monemee/client` (`createLicense({ productId })`, `activate`, `check`) or Python `monemee.License`.
- Secrets only in `.env`, and `.env` in `.gitignore`. Go live only when asked (`npx monemee live`).
- Docs: https://github.com/monemee/monemee-sdk/blob/main/AGENTS.md
